  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "ev1_body",
   "x": 116,
   "y": 1064,
   "width": 790,
   "height": 70,
   "text": "bead-work plan: approved. Approve with these corrections folded in; do not re-pause for them.\n  1. No buttons inside a summary. A summary is already a button; nested interactive content\n     is an accessibility problem. Make each row one action.\nbead-work run: PR .../pull/18, draft PR open; the repo has no CI gate; bead stays claimed until merge",
   "originalText": "bead-work plan: approved. Approve with these corrections folded in; do not re-pause for them.\n  1. No buttons inside a summary. A summary is already a button; nested interactive content\n     is an accessibility problem. Make each row one action.\nbead-work run: PR .../pull/18, draft PR open; the repo has no CI gate; bead stays claimed until merge",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
