  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "ev2_body",
   "x": 966,
   "y": 1064,
   "width": 540,
   "height": 70,
   "text": "\"major work you send to a beads-work, smaller work you\n offload to a subagent\"  (14:48, 13 Sep)\n\nbeads-work for multi-file behaviour changes; a subagent for\nbounded content work; the orchestrator for one-file items",
   "originalText": "\"major work you send to a beads-work, smaller work you\n offload to a subagent\"  (14:48, 13 Sep)\n\nbeads-work for multi-file behaviour changes; a subagent for\nbounded content work; the orchestrator for one-file items",
